WEBVTT

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:18.375
Jin!

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.490
You really are transferring out, huh?

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.152
But you'll still keep in touch, won't you?

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:40.871
Jin, take care.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:16.042
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:21.915
sono itami no imi sae

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:27.687
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:30.884
Boku wa kitto...

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:38.598
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:46.106
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.975
I'll always be with you

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:51.611
see the sky in front of you

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:55.980
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:57.717 --> 00:02:03.156
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.825
utau yo

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:14.494
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.318
Please, let me through!

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.753
Can't do that! Stand back!

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.983
A friend of mine is still in there!

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.926
I'll let you off this one time.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:43.293
You made me remember Amadeus, after all.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:50.803
Don't tell me you let them go, did you?

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.703
No, I didn't!

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:57.510
Not a very sincere little kid.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.137
Jin...

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:11.324
What are you going to do now?

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:14.027
Anywhere you go, someone will follow you.

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:17.564
At this rate, you will be
captured sooner or later.

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:20.867
I'm going back to Earth with Toa.

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:24.470
We'll live quietly, in some small
town that no one knows about.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.674
Then no one will find us.

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:31.337
I want you to come with me, Toa.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.840
Jin...

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:38.139
Mm-hmm.

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:53.892
Gio...

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.837
Would you come, too?

00:03:57.837 --> 00:03:59.239
Me, too?

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:02.508
Yeah. Let's live together.

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:06.579
I'm... not in the way?

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:08.114
In the way?

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:10.878
That's what Howling Star said.

00:04:13.386 --> 00:04:18.858
Ridiculous. Of course you're not.
Let's all three live together.

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.460
All three?

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:24.863
Yeah. Toa, me, and you, Gio. The three of us.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:00.391
Mother...

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:07.407
Yes, I know.

00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:10.610
It's not as though...

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:13.446
...I've forgotten my mission.

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:17.780
I will bring everyone back, without fail.

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:27.920
Jin...

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:36.302
I'm so glad you said you
would live together with me.

00:05:36.302 --> 00:05:40.206
I really wanted to do so, myself.

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:43.266
I wanted to be with you, Jin.

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:47.037
But...

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:54.320
There is something that I have to do.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.812
I'm sorry, Jin.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.537
Toa?

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:29.020
Toa!!

00:06:50.076 --> 00:06:52.011
Jin!

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:53.546
Stop darting around so much.

00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:55.047
But Toa is!

00:06:55.047 --> 00:07:00.041
Just settle down a bit. We're still
not sure she's been caught.

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:04.524
Gio!

00:07:04.524 --> 00:07:05.758
Let me go!

00:07:05.758 --> 00:07:07.385
Jin!

00:07:10.696 --> 00:07:12.098
Kazuki...

00:07:12.098 --> 00:07:14.794
I've finally found you.

00:07:23.476 --> 00:07:25.569
Get up, Jin!

00:07:33.786 --> 00:07:37.657
Please, let me go.

00:07:37.657 --> 00:07:43.129
Toa has disappeared. We were
together just a moment ago!

00:07:43.129 --> 00:07:44.730
Toa?

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.833
You mean the Album?

00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:52.572
That's why I can't let myself
be caught by you right now.

00:07:52.572 --> 00:07:55.241
- Please!
- Screw you!

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:57.910
As long as you're okay, everything's fine?!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:02.782
After taking Gio from me,
it doesn't matter how I feel, is that it?!

00:08:02.782 --> 00:08:06.853
Remember, Gio belongs to me!

00:08:06.853 --> 00:08:09.255
And you stole him from me!

00:08:09.255 --> 00:08:12.622
I just came here to take back
what was stolen from me!

00:08:17.864 --> 00:08:20.299
That day...

00:08:20.299 --> 00:08:24.668
the day of the shuttle
accident, you changed.

00:08:27.673 --> 00:08:30.276
Say whatever you will.

00:08:30.276 --> 00:08:35.515
Hit me as much as you like, if that's
what you want. But right now...

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:38.851
right now, let me go search for Toa.

00:08:38.851 --> 00:08:41.888
I want to see Toa!

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:43.489
Let me see him!

00:08:43.489 --> 00:08:45.558
Please, let me...

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:48.049
Let me see Jack!

00:08:55.234 --> 00:08:57.065
I don't "belong" to you.

00:08:58.804 --> 00:09:02.501
- Kazuki!
- I'm fine! Don't let Gio get away!

00:09:05.244 --> 00:09:06.836
Hold on to me!

00:09:22.528 --> 00:09:24.263
Why?

00:09:24.263 --> 00:09:28.000
Why does he choose Jin instead of me?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:32.004
Jin is not Gio's Master.

00:09:32.004 --> 00:09:34.734
I am!!

00:09:47.353 --> 00:09:51.857
The Album's readings have
completely disappeared.

00:09:51.857 --> 00:09:54.360
Things don't always go
the way you'd like them to.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.227
Service time is over, then?

00:10:02.435 --> 00:10:04.562
Shift change time.

00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:14.046
Yo!

00:10:14.046 --> 00:10:15.741
He's here?

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:18.484
So then,

00:10:18.484 --> 00:10:22.922
you're saying that the Girouard Force
brought about Spirytus' outburst?

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:26.092
You knew that they've been
trying to get their hands

00:10:26.092 --> 00:10:28.160
on the formula for Resonance, right?

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.762
Yeah.

00:10:29.762 --> 00:10:32.965
Preventing the exclusivity
of Communicators

00:10:32.965 --> 00:10:34.767
by announcing the existence
of Dragons to the world,

00:10:34.767 --> 00:10:37.403
and laying out the peril
of Earth's extinction...

00:10:37.403 --> 00:10:40.906
that's pretty much the scenario, isn't it?

00:10:40.906 --> 00:10:42.601
Indeed it is.

00:10:44.343 --> 00:10:48.481
Apparently, Major Garnet is
involved in this whole affair.

00:10:48.481 --> 00:10:50.416
- The major?
- Yeah.

00:10:50.416 --> 00:10:54.954
I've got evidence that she was
in contact with Amagi. However,

00:10:54.954 --> 00:10:58.858
the higher-ups are
keeping silent about this.

00:10:58.858 --> 00:11:02.028
The reports seem to have been
sidelined midway through.

00:11:02.028 --> 00:11:05.431
You think there's another snitch?

00:11:05.431 --> 00:11:11.203
Actually, I happened to catch Garnet
secretly talking to a certain someone.

00:11:11.203 --> 00:11:13.330
So, who is this person?

00:11:15.641 --> 00:11:18.978
That I don't know.

00:11:18.978 --> 00:11:20.605
Only they do.

00:11:25.051 --> 00:11:28.282
It's not nice to eavesdrop, Howling Star.

00:11:45.371 --> 00:11:49.000
My word, I sure am having
a lot of visitors today.

00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:16.402
Professor Nozaki!

00:12:16.402 --> 00:12:20.673
We did it! We captured the Album alive!

00:12:20.673 --> 00:12:22.108
The Album?

00:12:22.108 --> 00:12:26.101
Yes! We've finally obtained a live Original!

00:12:27.713 --> 00:12:32.218
I see... The Album is alive, is she?

00:12:32.218 --> 00:12:35.278
I certainly would like to meet her.

00:12:58.978 --> 00:13:03.549
Those are special restraints
that were made using CSS.

00:13:03.549 --> 00:13:07.720
She is unable to use her powers,
let alone Actualize.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.755
We'll see.

00:13:09.755 --> 00:13:12.291
I heard she came to us to be captured.

00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:15.055
What in the world is she thinking?

00:13:17.396 --> 00:13:21.594
Kazuki! Widow! What are
you doing on the Moon?

00:13:26.005 --> 00:13:31.577
Raina-san, what about Gio?
What are you doing about catching Gio?

00:13:31.577 --> 00:13:35.581
The Girouard Force is still overseeing that.

00:13:35.581 --> 00:13:40.609
Our mission is to capture the Album,
and deliver her back to base.

00:13:42.087 --> 00:13:44.924
You should be more
concerned about yourself.

00:13:44.924 --> 00:13:47.193
You're going to be penalized
when we get back to Earth

00:13:47.193 --> 00:13:49.753
for mobilizing without permission.

00:13:53.799 --> 00:13:57.102
Mobilizing without permission?
You came here with Widow?

00:13:57.102 --> 00:13:59.705
Widow, you Actualized?

00:13:59.705 --> 00:14:03.309
We're scheduled to take off at 20:30.

00:14:03.309 --> 00:14:07.541
Everyone be back to
your posts by then. Got it?

00:14:10.115 --> 00:14:13.016
That hairstyle doesn't look good on you.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.385
What exactly has come over you?

00:14:19.825 --> 00:14:23.283
Akira-chan, let's go have dinner.

00:14:26.198 --> 00:14:30.736
All right, then, let's go
get some chow. Coming?

00:14:30.736 --> 00:14:32.465
No, I'm not.

00:14:33.973 --> 00:14:36.642
Okay, fine.

00:14:36.642 --> 00:14:39.236
You're being immature, Akira-chan.

00:14:53.759 --> 00:14:55.427
Damn!

00:14:55.427 --> 00:15:01.400
What is going on?! She promised
we'd go back to Earth together!

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:03.269
Something's happened.

00:15:03.269 --> 00:15:05.066
You're right.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.577
The Album... Toa...

00:15:11.577 --> 00:15:14.546
has been captured by ISDA.

00:15:14.546 --> 00:15:16.173
Captured?

00:15:17.716 --> 00:15:22.021
Are you asking me to betray ISDA?

00:15:22.021 --> 00:15:23.889
How dare you?

00:15:23.889 --> 00:15:28.417
Kazuki, I want to get Toa back,
no matter what it takes.

00:15:30.763 --> 00:15:35.467
The shuttle that has her aboard
will be blasting off for Earth soon.

00:15:35.467 --> 00:15:40.572
Once that happens, it's all over.
You'll never be able to see her again.

00:15:40.572 --> 00:15:46.211
ISDA's research team is going
to make effective use of her.

00:15:46.211 --> 00:15:49.281
As a lab rat.

00:15:49.281 --> 00:15:50.908
I won't allow it!

00:15:53.052 --> 00:15:55.220
I am protecting this one.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.424
Hey, now, are you sure
you want to take that tone?

00:15:58.424 --> 00:16:01.291
You want to save the girl, don't you?

00:16:04.263 --> 00:16:06.131
Gio,

00:16:06.131 --> 00:16:07.655
back off.

00:16:11.904 --> 00:16:14.173
Please...

00:16:14.173 --> 00:16:16.334
...help us out.

00:16:23.582 --> 00:16:29.021
Well? How does it feel to have
something important taken away?

00:16:29.021 --> 00:16:33.425
Do you understand now how it
felt when you took Gio away?!

00:16:33.425 --> 00:16:35.325
I told you.

00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:39.756
I do not belong to you.

00:16:42.968 --> 00:16:44.526
Gio...

00:16:46.438 --> 00:16:50.542
Fine. Let's make a deal.

00:16:50.542 --> 00:16:53.545
Once I bring Toa here,

00:16:53.545 --> 00:16:55.706
give Gio back!

00:16:58.117 --> 00:17:02.187
There's not much time
before the shuttle takes off.

00:17:02.187 --> 00:17:05.858
Yes or no?

00:17:05.858 --> 00:17:08.694
Decide quickly, or it will be too late.

00:17:08.694 --> 00:17:14.360
Take Toa, or take Gio. One or the other.

00:17:35.187 --> 00:17:38.179
Then we have a deal.

00:17:54.006 --> 00:17:55.997
Keep quiet.

00:18:13.292 --> 00:18:15.920
You have someone waiting for you.

00:18:19.765 --> 00:18:21.934
Emergency alert!

00:18:21.934 --> 00:18:22.968
Widow?

00:18:22.968 --> 00:18:24.959
The Album has been taken!

00:18:28.607 --> 00:18:30.609
Where are you taking me?

00:18:30.609 --> 00:18:33.312
To Kamishina Jin.

00:18:33.312 --> 00:18:35.380
Let me go! Let me go!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:39.373
Why? Don't you want to go see him?

00:18:43.789 --> 00:18:46.258
I do...

00:18:46.258 --> 00:18:50.329
But I can't! I can't see him!

00:18:50.329 --> 00:18:53.298
If you want to see him, then you should.

00:19:04.743 --> 00:19:06.768
I'm sorry.

00:19:10.349 --> 00:19:12.112
Are you angry?

00:19:14.753 --> 00:19:17.823
Agreeing to that was the
only way to save Toa, right?

00:19:17.823 --> 00:19:19.691
If the situation were reversed, you'd...

00:19:19.691 --> 00:19:22.494
Can you...

00:19:22.494 --> 00:19:25.520
Can you protect Toa?

00:19:29.101 --> 00:19:31.001
I will protect her!

00:19:32.804 --> 00:19:34.704
I see...

00:19:36.642 --> 00:19:40.373
Then it looks like I really am in the way.

00:19:47.186 --> 00:19:48.654
It's me.

00:19:48.654 --> 00:19:50.281
I brought her.

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:01.292
Toa!

00:20:05.237 --> 00:20:06.972
Toa?

00:20:06.972 --> 00:20:11.910
Now, like you promised, give Gio back.

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:13.537
Yeah.

00:20:29.761 --> 00:20:31.388
Go on.

00:20:35.734 --> 00:20:41.331
What's the matter? Hurry on back to Jin.
He'll be sure to protect you.

00:20:44.576 --> 00:20:46.545
I'm not going.

00:20:46.545 --> 00:20:48.172
Toa!

00:20:49.548 --> 00:20:52.384
I'm not going back!

00:20:52.384 --> 00:20:54.944
W-What are you saying, Toa?!

00:20:56.288 --> 00:20:58.757
Come on, hurry on over.

00:20:58.757 --> 00:21:00.952
I mean it!

00:21:02.561 --> 00:21:05.397
I can't stay with you, Jin.

00:21:05.397 --> 00:21:09.629
Why not? You said we'd
go back to Earth together.

00:21:28.387 --> 00:21:30.321
Is this?

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:46.297
Ai...

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:52.077
I'm the one who collided with the shuttle.

00:21:52.077 --> 00:21:55.638
I'm the one who killed your family, Jin!

00:22:07.626 --> 00:22:14.299
Me to me ga atta shunkan

00:22:14.299 --> 00:22:21.106
kanashimi ga hajimaru ki ga shita

00:22:21.106 --> 00:22:27.779
Keshite mo kienai kioku ima demo

00:22:27.779 --> 00:22:34.981
futari no kokoro tsunaide'ru

00:22:36.822 --> 00:22:43.662
Ikusen no hoshi no kazu hodo hito wa

00:22:43.662 --> 00:22:46.665
afurete iru no ni ne

00:22:46.665 --> 00:22:50.535
kimi shika mienai

00:22:50.535 --> 00:22:53.705
Aenakute mo

00:22:53.705 --> 00:22:56.641
kanawanakute mo

00:22:56.641 --> 00:23:02.914
tsunoru omoi wa kitto eien

00:23:02.914 --> 00:23:09.921
Unmei ga futari wo hikisaku nara

00:23:09.921 --> 00:23:16.762
deaeta koto dake wo kiseki to shinjite

00:23:16.762 --> 00:23:23.368
Hora nagarete'ku kono ame no you

00:23:23.368 --> 00:23:29.408
Itoshisa dake wo kimi ni furasetai

00:23:29.408 --> 00:23:33.606
Rain of Love

00:23:42.721 --> 00:23:44.589
This is ISDA operator Saki.

00:23:44.589 --> 00:23:46.057
- And Ryoko.
- And Megumi.

00:23:46.057 --> 00:23:48.360
- Okay, on the next episode of Dragonaut...
- Too early, too early!

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:49.928
But we're always just squeezing it in.

00:23:49.928 --> 00:23:52.030
No, no, haste makes waste, you know?

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:54.399
But she can get lost even if she has a map.

00:23:54.399 --> 00:23:56.468
She didn't come back to the dorm
for six whole hours the other day.

00:23:56.468 --> 00:23:58.270
Speaking of coming home,
I wonder if everyone

00:23:58.270 --> 00:23:59.704
will be coming back from the Moon soon.

00:23:59.704 --> 00:24:02.207
Long ago, they'd say that an outing
was still an outing until you came home.

00:24:02.207 --> 00:24:05.210
That's right. You let your
guard down on the way home.

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:09.476
In other words, next time, going away
is fine, but coming back is scary!
